        <body>
            <div xml:id="d79">

                <pb facs="0155" n="95" sameAs="frus:frus1895p1/pg95"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Denby to Mr. Olney</hi>.</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Peking</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-07-12"><hi rendition="#italic">July 12, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received August 23.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 2288.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to inform you that I have
                    designated Rev. Spencer Lewis, a resident of Chungking, to act as the American
                    member of a commission to examine into the causes and results of the Szechuan
                    riots.</p>
                <p>I have addressed to Mr. Lewis a communication, of which a copy is inclosed,
                    wherein the purposes of this commission, the constitution thereof, and its
                    duties are set forth.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Denby</hi></signed>.</closer>


                <xi:include href="d79-a1.xml" xpointer="d79-a1"/>
            </div>
